---
const decks = [
  {slug:'comportements', name:'Les bons réflexes', image:'reflexes', count:10},
  {slug:'sante', name:'Trouver son équilibre', image:'equilibre', count:8},
  {slug:'ecologie', name:'Derrière nos écrans', image:'ecologie', count:11},
];
---
<section class="quiz-press" data-scene="jeu" aria-labelledby="play-title">
  <div class="work-wrap">
    <div class="play-heading">
      <div><p class="print-credit">Le jeu en ligne</p><h2 id="play-title">À vous de <em>jouer.</em></h2></div>
      <p>Choisissez un thème. Pour chaque question, cochez vos réponses et retournez la carte pour lire le corrigé.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="table-packs">
      {decks.map(deck => <li class={`pack-${deck.slug}`}>
        <a href={`/quiz/${deck.slug}`}>
          <div class="pack-bed"><img data-motion src={`/assets/previews/carte-${deck.image}.webp`} width="800" height="566" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <span class="pack-label"><strong>{deck.name}</strong><small>{deck.count} cartes</small></span>
        </a>
      </li>)}
    </ul>
    <div class="play-all"><a class="line-action" href="/quiz">Voir les quatre quiz</a><a class="ink-action" href="/quiz/tout">Jouer les 29 cartes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
